Rem AMCAF Turbo Plot and Turbo Point (the golden is the original's)
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Screen Open 1,320,200,2,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Screen Open 2,320,200,64,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Screen Open 3,320,200,4,Hires : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Screen Open 4,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
For N=0 To 4
Screen N
Turbo Plot 10,10,5 : Turbo Plot 11,10,3 : Turbo Plot 319,199,15 : Turbo Plot 0,0,31
Turbo Plot 320,10,1 : Turbo Plot 10,200,1 : Turbo Plot -1,10,1 : Turbo Plot 10,-1,1 : Turbo Plot 10,10,-1
Turbo Plot 100,100,63 : Turbo Plot 101,100,1 : Turbo Plot 100,101,64 : Turbo Plot 639,100,7
Print #1,"point";N;Turbo Point(10,10);Turbo Point(11,10);Turbo Point(12,10);Turbo Point(319,199);Turbo Point(0,0);Turbo Point(100,100);Turbo Point(101,100);Turbo Point(100,101)
Print #1,"out";Turbo Point(320,10);Turbo Point(10,200);Turbo Point(-1,10);Turbo Point(10,-1);Turbo Point(639,100)
Turbo Plot 50,50,5 : Turbo Plot 50,50,2
Print #1,"over";Turbo Point(50,50)
Print #1,"ink";Point(10,10);Point(100,100)
Next N
